      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Paper card with hairline border; lifts and warms on hover.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><h3>Automation &amp; Tooling</h3><p>Less repetition, more room to think.</p><div class=\"ds-card-tags\">SCRIPTS · DEVELOPER EXPERIENCE</div></article>",
